OL,4,BCummins retains Cricket Australia      
OL,5,Bsupport as captain                     
OL,6,GPat Cummins will retain backing from   
OL,7,GCricket Australia (CA) to remain as    
OL,8,GTest captain despite ongoing and       
OL,9,Gexplosive allegations about the        
OL,10,Gsandpaper controversy.                 
OL,12,FA detailed testimony from Cameron      
OL,13,FBancroft supported previous claims     
OL,14,Fmade by Usman Khawaja that the entire  
OL,15,FAustralia team - including Cummins -   
OL,16,Fknew of the plan to tamper with the    
OL,17,Fball during a Test match against South 
OL,18,FAfrica in Cape Town in 2018.           
